WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:19.391
MLS listens to the visit and writes the note.

2
00:00:19.441 --> 00:00:38.833
Everything the practice uses, one screen at a
time.

3
00:00:38.883 --> 00:01:02.676
The dock at the bottom moves between screens.

4
00:01:02.726 --> 00:01:26.520
Tools in the dock holds Staff prep, Templates
and Settings.

5
00:01:26.570 --> 00:01:53.181
Tools > Settings > Connections & integrations.
The Web Store button is the normal install.

6
00:01:53.231 --> 00:02:19.842
The direct zip is the second option, for
practices that pin exact versions.

7
00:02:19.892 --> 00:02:43.856
Click a patient to make them active - visits
attach to them.

8
00:02:43.906 --> 00:03:07.869
Merge only groups charts with a shared MRN, or
a name AND date of birth.

9
00:03:07.919 --> 00:03:34.545
Tools > Practice > Staff prep. Keep athenaOne
open on Calendar > View Calendar.

10
00:03:34.595 --> 00:04:01.221
The pull is read-only in athena, and
already-saved visits are never doubled.

11
00:04:01.271 --> 00:04:23.485
Pick the month, check the doctor, press Start
month pull.

12
00:04:23.535 --> 00:04:45.749
Pause, resume, and Retry failed days.
Already-pulled days are skipped.

13
00:04:45.799 --> 00:05:08.818
Pick the patient, open Visit, press Start
Recording.

14
00:05:08.868 --> 00:05:31.886
Pause and resume freely - nothing is lost, and
nothing reaches athena yet.

15
00:05:31.936 --> 00:05:54.060
Press Generate one note - one note from
everything you captured.

16
00:05:54.110 --> 00:06:16.234
Switch style and length, and see which
template was used.

17
00:06:16.284 --> 00:06:43.947
The sheet shows the exact patient, visit and
destination field first.

18
00:06:43.997 --> 00:07:11.661
MLS never signs. Sign & Save stays your own
click in athenaOne.

19
00:07:11.711 --> 00:07:38.639
Tools > Practice > Templates. Upload one
multi-form PDF, or many files at once.

20
00:07:38.689 --> 00:08:05.617
Click a saved template to edit, rename,
duplicate, or set as default.

21
00:08:05.667 --> 00:08:29.371
Dock > Tools > Prep op notes opens the op-note
room.

22
00:08:29.421 --> 00:08:53.125
Check the procedure, pick the template, press
Draft op note.

23
00:08:53.175 --> 00:09:20.771
Every blank lands in one Fields box above the
note.

24
00:09:20.821 --> 00:09:48.417
A note with a blank in it is never offered to
athena.

25
00:09:48.467 --> 00:10:11.555
All scheduled patients, pick a day, press
Draft all op notes.

26
00:10:11.605 --> 00:10:34.694
Drafts save to History only - nothing goes to
athena automatically.

27
00:10:34.744 --> 00:10:53.763
AI Studio > Practice > Month & year report:
per doctor, with honest provenance.

28
00:10:53.813 --> 00:11:12.831
Help answers questions about this app
specifically.
